window.products.push({"id":800017,"name":"Filtration Group 10381 400 Series Standard Capacity Pleated Air Filter, Synthetic Media, White, 8 MERV, 14 Height x 20 Width x 2 Depth (Case of 12)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71saeCI2-cL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Filtration Group 400 Series Pleated air filters incorporates moisture resistant, 100% synthetic media. The media is bonded to a metal grid on exiting side, preventing fluttering and maintaining uniformity of pleats. The filter pack is enclosed in a heavy-duty, moisture resistant, die-cut frame that will not warp, crack or distort under normal operating conditions. The media pack is bonded to every part of the frame, preventing any possiblity of air by-pass. The 400 Series accumulates the heavier, more restrictive particles at the bottom of the pleats, leaving the sides open longer for effective filtration. It's media is engineered to provide maximum efficiency. In general, deeper pleats result in longer filter life and more time between change-outs. The 400 Series can be used without modification in side-access housing or built-up filter banks. They offer better efficiency than conventional permanent or disposable filters. These pleated filters may be used as pre-filters, substantially extending the life of more expensive high-efficiency filters. They are the perfect solution for residential, commercial and industrial use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71saeCI2-cL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Filtration Group","source_asin":"B00BARKA48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BARKA48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BARKA48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
