window.products.push({"id":800026,"name":"Newhai Commercial Vegetable Dicer Electric Fruit Dicing Machine Heavy Duty Stainless Steel for Cubes 5/16’’ 15/32’’Blade 110V US","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":629.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+Vzk3cXpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMMERCIAL GRADE---This vegetable dicer is specifically designed for commercial use. With its 150W powerful pure copper motor, this machine is capable of cutting vegetables and fruits into perfect cubes in just minutes, saving you both time and labor. Featuring an easy-to-use design, the dicer allows you to complete chopping tasks with minimal effort. Simply place the carrots or other vegetables in the feed port, turn on the power, and the machine will automatically start chopping, freeing up your hands for other tasks. LEVER HANDLE DESIGN---This upgraded vegetable cube cutter features a labor-saving lever design. When you press down on the handle, the spring rod is effortlessly pushed away, saving you more effort compared to the previous hand-pulled version. Before use, it's important to install the lever and the two balls to ensure proper function. This newly upgraded vegetable cube cutter is perfect for both commercial kitchens and home use, allowing you to quickly and easily prepare vegetables and fruits for salads, soups, stews, and more. STAINLESS STEEL---This automatic vegetable dicer boasts a high-quality construction, with a machine body constructed using top-grade 304 stainless steel. This material is incredibly durable, resistant to rust and corrosion, and can easily be washed with water, making it effortless to maintain. The superior construction of this dicer ensures that it can withstand even the most demanding of kitchen environments and provide reliable performance for years to come. WIDE APPLICATIONS---This cube cutting machine is ideal for dicing a wide variety of ingredients, including onions, carrots, cucumbers, ham, potatoes, pumpkin, lettuce, white radish, and more. The output cube is always even and neat, ensuring that every slice is consistent and of top quality. This feature makes it perfect for use in busy commercial kitchens such as restaurants, canteens, fruit shops, milk tea shops, dessert shops, and any other busy food establishment where time and precision are of the essence. NOTICE---THIS MACHINE IS ONLY FOR DICING. The blade sizes are 8mmX8mm and 12mmX12mm cubes. The blade needs to be replaced after long time use. The voltage is 110volts US plug. The size of the food trough is 11.25’’X3’’. If the size of the food exceeds the trough, you can firstly cut them into smaller chunks. The slicer blade and shredder blade in our store can be also installed on the dicer machine. Please buy additional blade if you need it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+Vzk3cXpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newhai","source_asin":"B09T2DFDS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T2DFDS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T2DFDS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":800027,"name":"Kate and Laurel Stallard Decorative Wood Home Wall Organizer Mirror with Pockets and Key Hooks, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":145.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hdBFTNNBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This organizational board combines rustic chic home décor with functionality. The outer dimensions measure 24 inches across and 24 inches high with a depth of 3. 5 inches. The decorative board contains a 20. 25 inch by 14. 25 inch mirror to check you appearance one final time before leaving the house. (You look great! ) The board also has three double metal hooks so your days of searching for your keys are over! The hooks are sturdy enough for full key chains or other odds and ends that you would like to hang. Also included are three pockets 7 inches across with a 1. 5 inch lip to store your important mail, bills, dog leashes, or other accessories off of the top of your counter. The cubbies have metal label holders which you can customize however you would like. This functional board has sturdy wood construction with two keyhole hangers built into the back for easy display. This multi-functional wall hanging board is the perfect tool to organize to your office, kitchen, or entryway.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hdBFTNNBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B0C2LKNVB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2LKNVB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2LKNVB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":800028,"name":"NAO First Love. Porcelain Bride and Groom Figure.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":228.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aDRsMGJnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Nao porcelain sculptures are hand crafted in Valencia, Spain where pioneers in the European porcelain industry have been creating timeless works of art since the company's inception in 1953. This blend of old-world craftsmanship and the latest ceramic technology ensures that each individual Nao sculpture is finished to perfection and will be cherished for generations to come. Nao's extensive collection of more than 300 sculptures captures the unforgettable moments of life including motherhood, weddings, childhood, falling in love, the joy of pets, the beauty of nature, religion and much more. Both gift-givers and discriminating collectors alike will appreciate the quality and attention to detail that signifies each and every Nao sculpture. Nao, part of the Lladro group, is sold in more than 122 countries around the world. Amazon.com Playful and promising, this Nao First Love figurine portrays a smitten young couple in a private moment of affection. The pair sits on a stone bench regarding each other demurely, their heads almost touching. The mood is sweet and optimistic, with an air of timelessness underscored by the couple's traditional clothing. Crafted by hand from fine porcelain in the famous Lladro studios of Spain, the piece's coloring is warm and its details are impressive. The buds in the girl's bouquet, the buttons on the boy's coat, even the texturing of the bench, all receive careful attention. A glossy overglaze adds a gleam from reflected light while protecting the fine materials. The piece bears the Nao stamp on its underside and measures approximately 6-1/2 inches high. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aDRsMGJnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAO","source_asin":"B0001WW2RQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001WW2RQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001WW2RQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
