window.products.push({"id":800064,"name":"Anzona Tulip Curtain Valance 54\" x 18\", Retro Blue Floral Window Valances Rod Pocket Curtains Drapes, Vintage Blooming Flowers Short Topper Curtain fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NTyZmZhAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Anzona Curtain Valance for Window 54\" x 18\" Material: 100% High Quailty Polyester Package: 1 Panel Window Valance Size: 54 x 18 Inch(137 x 45 cm) Why Choose Anzona Valance? 1. Our window valance curtain is made of high-quality polyester, thermal printing technology and precise manual tailoring, adding a gorgeous atmosphere to your home, while the soft and smooth touch makes it more comfortable and gorgeous.2. Rod pocket design curtain is easy for you to install an slide, with 1\" header and 3 inches rod pocket on top, fits most standard rods/pole.3. Used to cover the higher portion of windows, blend in easily with your kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, laundry room, living room, dining room, infant room, kids room, nursery, office, hotel or other public place. Perfect choice for children's room or any small windows. 4. These elegant polyester materials have a high-quality soft touch, adding fresh charm to your windows, allowing beautiful diffused light to enter, while providing privacy protection.5. Of course, these curtains can also be used as a gift for Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Valentine's Day, Easter, Independence Day, St. Patrick Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day to reflect your wishes. Warm Tips 1. If you find creases when you receive our Anzona window curtains valance, this is normal. You can quickly iron or steam clean at low temperature after cleaning to remove wrinkles.2. As all computers are calibrated differently, there may be color variations between actual product and your screen.3. All curtains' dimensions are measured manually with deviation （ranged）at 1 inch.4.If you encounter any problems during the shopping process, you can contact us in time, and we will provide you with solutions within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NTyZmZhAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anzona","source_asin":"B09H79PYVB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H79PYVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H79PYVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":800065,"name":"Sacred Source Bast Sistrum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k7G-xMkgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Chants, songs, incense; the ringing jingle of the sistrum was central to Egyptian goddess worship. We have recreated this Egyptian sacred rattle to glorify Bast. Its tinkling evokes energy and a mood of good cheer. Egyptian Priestesses used sistrums to create a circle of protection around themselves and the deity image and to banish unwanted negative energy. Bast, the Sacred Cat, symbolized the moon in its function of making a woman fruitful, with swelling womb. She was also the Egyptian goddess of pleasure, music, dancing and joy. 11 1/4\" copper and resin sistrum, black gold color finish. #BS","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k7G-xMkgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sacred Source","source_asin":"B00AB0N5LU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AB0N5LU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AB0N5LU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
