window.products.push({"id":800085,"name":"Ecohindu Handmade Natural Stone Thiruvaikal-Grinding Stone, Big Mortar & Pestle Set,Grinder For Corn,Wheat & Whole Grains,Nut Mill,Natural & Unpolishe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PlsZQsfZL._AC_SL1306_.jpg","description":"Stone Thiruvaikal is a hand-carved product made from a stone known from its toughness and strength. This Thiruvaikal is a natural grinder, round in shape, with spiral rings originating from the center. Moreover, this grinder is used for grinding leaves and related ingredients that are to be ground. Add this graceful grinder to your kitchen for a traditional feel. Usage Instructions- Cleaning – We advise to use good utensil soap and warm water. Care – It does not corrode so, wash the Stone Thiruvaikal immediately after use. Wash – Avoid using a metal scrubber. Rinse in warm water and then dry thoroughly. Dust – Moreover, use a soft cloth to keep the product dust-free Warning – We highly advise you to Do Not Microwave this product. Eco-factor:- The Indian continent played a significant role in putting stone made utensils on the map. The discovery of these stone utensils dates back to time immemorial Likewise, Our ancestors have been mainly using stone utensils in the kitchen. The reason behind this is that stone is the most durable material. But also because the stone made Thiruvaikal incorporated some great health benefits. Benefits:- Stone has quite a number of advantages due to which it is both attractive and health beneficial. Stone is strong and hard, thus, it allows assuring that the products are durable and scratch-free The health benefits that stone made Thiruvaikal procures is that it is good for your immunity. Disclaimer:- Since we provide unique and handcrafted products, there can be a slight difference with regards to dimensions and weight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PlsZQsfZL._AC_SL1306_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ecoHindu - Lokah samastah sukhino bhavantu Back to eco-friendly traditions","source_asin":"B08T9VTDZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T9VTDZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T9VTDZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
