window.products.push({"id":800091,"name":"YARA Gender Neutral Baby Shower Decorations for Boy & Girl | Burlap Welcome Baby Banner | Woodland Rustic Boho Theme Oh Baby Decoration Reveal & Birth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q8m7a0ItL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Burlap ✨PREMIUM QUALITY ALL IN ONE DECOR SET: Oh baby, you're going to love our rustic baby shower decor for boys & girls that includes everything you need to make your party sparkle. The 23 piece boho baby shower decorations kit includes one \"Welcome\" burlap banner, one \"Baby\" pre-strung banner, 8 vintage party fans made with premium gold foil, and 12 rustic glam tassels with gold string (tassel colors include: white, ivory, brown, tan, beige and white with tan polka dots). ✨VERSATILE & REUSABLE PARTY SUPPLIES: Perfect for gender reveal party, fall baby shower decorations, rustic theme birthday parties, welcome home event, pregnancy announcement, winter photo shoot backdrop, maternity photos, or decorating your nursery wall! The earthy colors pair beautifully with rustic, bohemian, whimsical, jungle, vintage or woodland theme parties. All items are reusable! Our non-toxic burlap baby shower decorations are made with premium materials that stand the test of time! ✨QUICK & EASY SET UP: Fans are pre-taped with medium strength glue so they can be reused, simply peel the film and stick the ends together (paper clips included for reinforcement). The 100% natural jute Welcome Banner is PRE-STRUNG, simply unfold and hang. Tassels are easy to assemble, visual instructions are included for your convenience. This rustic decor kit has everything you need to fully decorate for any boho chic party. Use indoor, outdoor, hang on ceilings, walls, tables, trees & more! ✨WHY CHOOSE YARA? YARA is a self-made, women owned company started in 2017 by a mother of two beautiful girls. All of our baby shower decor is designed with the Mommy and Baby in mind with the mission of helping you create eternal memories. Our party supplies are professionally made with the highest quality materials and go through maximum quality testing. Decorate your next birthday party or baby shower with our unique designs that can't be found anywhere else! ✨BUY NOW RISK FREE - USA COMPANY - 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We're super confident you and your guests will love this adorable gender neutral baby shower decorations kit! However, if for any reason you're not absolutely thrilled with your burlap banners, rustic fans or elegant tassels, just let us know! We'll give you a full refund - no questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q8m7a0ItL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YARA","source_asin":"B07PQT5YTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PQT5YTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PQT5YTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
