window.products.push({"id":800241,"name":"FANRUIQI Headrest Pillow for Car Seat, Memory Foam Neck Support Pillow for Neck Pain Relief - U-Shaped Ergonomic Design Soft Travel Pillow for Sleepin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aKlECWQ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Comfortable Ergonomic Design: This car neck pillow designed with ergonomic streamline and U-type perfectly fits your body curve and provides comfortable support to your shoulder, neck and head. It greatly reduces the chance of you developing neck pain or numbness while driving or sleeping in long trip for drivers and passengers. ✅High Quality Memory Foam: The car/ chair headrest pillow is made of high density memory foam, it will get back to normal after you fold it into any shape, it is very convenient to carry. It is soft and no smelling, put your head on it, you will feel comfortable and relaxation. ✅Various Occasions of Use: This neck support pillow is suitable for using in cars, office, home, E-Sports clubs for people who will sit for long time. Especially it is really useful for the passengers, office workers and game players to rest and sleep on the seats and chairs. And put it on the desk, using it to rest or sleep is a good choice too. ✅Breathable and Washable Cover: The soft and breathable cloth cover with smooth surface treatment, won’t hurt your skin. The back of the cover has the zipper, it is very easy and convenient to take the memory foam out then clean and wash the cover. ✅Easy to Install and Carry: This head resting pillow has an elastic band and adjustable clips on the back of the headrest, it can be can be secured tightly on the seat, you can adjust the height of the headrest. And the memory foam is very light, you can fold it, then just put it in your bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aKlECWQ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FANRUIQI","source_asin":"B0B8H9JPGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8H9JPGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8H9JPGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":800242,"name":"Pavo Personalized Fleece Blanket to My Grandson - Always Remember How Much I Love You - Customized Elephant Blanket for Birthday, Thanksgiving - 30\" x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-LZTspclS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ [EXCLUSIVE DESIGNS] Finding thoughtful gifts for your grandson isn't always easy. That's why we are here to help. There's no gift that speaks \"I love you\" more than a blanket with meaningful messages. This super soft and cozy blanket is a perfect way to tell your grandson that \"Stay strong, be confident & just do your best.\" At Pavo, our highly skilled designers always cater to your needs and strive to turn every gift idea into reality by handling each request with great care ✅ [CUSTOM TAILORED FOR SPECIAL OCCASIONS] Cherish your loved one's celebrations by sharing precious memories with our customized blanket. Pavo's custom fleece blanket will be the perfect present for your parents, spouse, siblings, children, and friends on various occasions like Birthday, Valentine's, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Engagement, Wedding, Anniversary, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas, etc. ✅ [MULTIPLE SIZES - MULTIPLE FUNCTIONS] Pavo's customized blanket comes in various sizes 30\"x40\", 50\"x60\", and 60\"x80\". Hence, our blanket can be used as sofa blanket, bed blanket, bed sheets, tapestry wall hanging, or a great addition to your comforter set. It is also perfect for outdoor activity like camping or go to the beach. Whether you want it in your bedroom for extra warmth, or in the living room for a stylish touch, this throw can keep you comfort in any space. ✅ [EXQUISITE FLEECE FABRIC] Each fleece blanket features a premium polyester print for beautiful color vibrancy, even after washing. This blanket is reversible with one side mimicking soft fur while the other is smooth fleece. The fabric is tested to be durable while also keeping you cozy. ✅ [GUARANTEE] Your satisfaction is our first priority. If you have any issues with the product, please feel free to contact us to get a replacement or a full refund. We will try our best to accommodate every inconvenience and problem that our customers encounter with great care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-LZTspclS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavo","source_asin":"B08SQWQQZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SQWQQZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SQWQQZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
