window.products.push({"id":800248,"name":"Chive ‘Frost’ Ceramic Flower Vase — Set of 6 Beautiful Small Bud Vases for Flowers & House Plants — Perfect Shelf Centerpieces and Living Room Decor —","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qoS+WKBTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The 'Frost' Vase — These adorable clay bud vases are perfect for short flower cuttings and single stems. Sold in a set of 6, you can use multiple pieces to cluster a few together for a simple centerpiece. Pottery has never been so cute! Beautiful, Yet Practical — Each Frost Vase is made from fully glazed ceramic with a matte finish so that you can confidently fill them with water before arranging your flowers inside it. They're dishwasher safe for easy cleaning, and measures 3” wide and 3.5” tall. Be the Envy of Your Friends — Looking for a unique way to spruce up your indoor and outdoor living spaces? Add a decorative charm to any room with an assortment of vibrant flower pots, vases, terrariums, and hanging planters. Our impressive selection of indoor & outdoor pots and planters are a beautiful way to showcase your household or patio plants and add a touch of dynamism to any area. Inspired by Nature — Chive's fresh, new-school designs are original, dynamic and committed to showcasing the very best in nature-inspired style. Show off stunning floral arrangements with our range of decorative glass and ceramic vases, available in a variety of shapes, colors, and functionalities. Our products make unique gift ideas, whether you’re a fan of classic timelessness, rustic elegance, or contemporary charm. A Reputable Brand, Since 2004 — For more than 16 years, Chive has created innovative and simple designs to highlight the unique beauty of your floral arrangements. Chive’s elegant vases and planters easily complement any setting, from classic to contemporary, and are a wonderful addition to any home, business, wedding or event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qoS+WKBTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHIVE","source_asin":"B07D4R8Z88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D4R8Z88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D4R8Z88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
