window.products.push({"id":800286,"name":"Ice-Sheets Cooling & Heating Mattress Pad System","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819s6PY6NlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finally!! An Affordable cooling/heating mattress solution from Ice-Sheets. This listing is for a brand new boxed set including a cooling/heating control unit, a 27\" x 34\" mattress pad...Everything you need to start sleeping better and saving money on your electric bill. Ice-Sheets Cooling/Heating system is essentially a climate control system for your bed. The control unit heats or cools water to a temperature of your choice between 46°F and 118°F and circulates it through the mattress pad positioned on the bed. Ice-Sheets solves an age old physics problem…the temperature at which we sleep best, is typically not the ambient temperature. Until recently, there was only one solution….heat, or cool your entire home to the desired temperature, even though all you really needed heated or cooled was the ~30 square feet your mattress takes up. Think about how incredibly inefficient this is!! In the summer it is even worse, because to get to a comfortable temperature under the covers, you really have to crank down the AC just to overcome your body’s own 98.6° heat generation. And that’s why we think this is a phenomenal product. Not only will your Ice-Sheets Heating and Cooling system help you get a (invaluable) better night’s sleep, it can actually save enough electricity to pay for itself. Of course, we can’t guarantee that…it depends heavily on your climate, your electric rates, home size etc.… but it is definitely possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819s6PY6NlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ice-Sheets","source_asin":"B01N1KRYSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1KRYSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1KRYSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
