window.products.push({"id":800296,"name":"CUSIMAX 10-in-1 Convection Oven, 24QT Air Fryer Combo, Countertop Air Fryer Toaster Oven with Rotisserie & Dehydrator, Rich Accessories, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L+2IwSZIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[10-in-1 Functionality] CUSIMAX Air Fryer Toaster Oven is a versatile and high performance countertop convection oven. The air fryer is equipped with 10 cooking functions to choose from: FRENCH FRY, PIZZA, TOAST, BAKE, AIR ROAST, AIR BROIL, ROTISSERIES, GRILLED FISH, THAW and VEGETABLE. Providing you all kinds of ways to make easy and delicious food, one machine can meet your different cooking needs, help you save space and money. CUSIMAX Air Fryer Oven, make cooking more convenient. [Faster & Healthier Cooking] The air fryer is provided with 1700W power motor and adopts 360° air convection technology and the top heating element with fan help increases warm air flow circulation more faster, which makes cooking evenly and locking in moisture, let the food more flavorful and crispier. Compared to traditional frying, this cooking method up to 75% less fat and grease, making for healthier meals. [Simple & Thoughtful Design] The toaster oven features the simple intuitive control knobs and LED digital screen, you can select various cooking modes at will. Each program has preset the temperature and time, you also choose the desired temperature and time for your own needs. (Temperature Range: 140-450℉. Time Range: 1 min-180 mins.) In addition, thanks to the glass door and bulit-in cooking light, you can cheack the status of food at all times, don't worry about overcooking anymore. [24.3QT Extra-Large Capacity & 7 Useful Accessories] The air fryer oven has a spacious 24.3QT capacity, you can easily cook a large batch of french fries or chicken wings, toast many slices of bread, roast a whole chicken or other favorite meals. Ideal for family meals and friend gatherings. With 7 DISHWASHER-SAFE accessories: Air Fryer Basket, Wire Rack, Baking Tray, Crumb Tray, Rotisserie Forks, Rotisserie Handle and Rack Handle to make cooking and cleaning a breeze. [Buy With Confidence] CUSIMAX aims at offering each customer outstanding products and the best service all the time. Our Air Fryer Toaster Oven is guaranteed for 12 Months Warranty and supports for Free Lifetime Customer Service. If you have any questions or need any help during use, please feel free to contact us via email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L+2IwSZIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUSIMAX","source_asin":"B0BWD7ZX37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWD7ZX37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWD7ZX37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
