window.products.push({"id":800417,"name":"Welhome Aidan Cotton Percale King Quilt Set with Pillowcase Shams - 3 Piece | Quilt King Size: 108” x 92” | Oversized Bedding | Lightweight Bed Quilt ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bOKx6BfoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY STYLISH DESIGN as you can choose from a range of color options for versatility or fashionable pops of color. Designed for everyday comfort and use. Features an ornate scroll pattern stitching for a beautiful eye-catching detail. Perfect for layering all seasons and will be sure to compliment any existing decor with the look of soft luxury. Pair or gift with the Cozy Duvet Cover Set and 200TC Solid Cotton Percale Sheet Set by Welspun Basics complete the look. Each sold separately. SLEEP WELL with a comfortable 100% cotton quilt. Woven into a lightweight 144-threadcount percale weave in a basic crisscross pattern using a one-over, one under structure providing a crisp and cool texture that is soft to the touch and tightly woven for durability. Easy to pair with duvet covers, blankets, throws and decorative pillows. Full/Queen Set Includes: 1 Quilt (92in x 92in) 2 standard shams (20in x 26in). King/Cal-King Set Includes: 1 Quilt (108in x 92in) 2 king shams (20in x 36in). MUST HAVE FEATURES as you enjoy a peaceful sleep with unparalleled artistry and design. Transform any space with a luxurious cotton percale fabric. Crafted with bound edges, mitered corners and washed for additional everyday softness that remains durable while getting even softer over time and use. Pillow shams include center overlap closure to secure pillow fill. Both quilt and sham fill are crafted with a lightweight 150 GSM, 100% Polyester for breathability and warmth. QUALITY MATERIAL AND EASY CARE, standard machine washable, soft and breathable, lightweight cotton perfect for an irresistible slumber. Machine wash cold, delicate cycle with like colors. Use large capacity washer and dryer. Do not bleach, tumble dry low. Do not iron or dry clean. DESIGNED WITH CARE, Product is Made in Oeko-Tex Standard 100 Factory, an independent Certification system that ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards. Our products are also made using environmentally sustainable farming practices and water saving technologies. We care about the environment and guarantee our manufacturing is leading the way to a better tomorrow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bOKx6BfoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welhome","source_asin":"B09K7S3GFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7S3GFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7S3GFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
