window.products.push({"id":800532,"name":"2 Pack Fall Maple Leaf Garland - 6ft/Piece Artificial Fall Foliage Garland Thanksgiving Fireplace Festival Decor for Home Wedding Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ambjUYIRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Delicate Artificial Garlands: The faux maple leaf garlands are crafted using silk and plastic material with fine details. They feature veiny-textured, dimensional maple leaves in assorted warm autumn colors. The main strand is internally wired to retain the desired shape. Their rich colors and pliable structure make the cascade effect attractive and easy to achieve. Bring the Outdoors in Your Home: The Maple Leaf Garlands are perfect for placing along banister, on the fireplace mantel, draping from rafters or beams, winding around pillars, attaching to the top of cabinets and shelves, hanging from ceiling, decorating a light pole, porch, lantern top or curving into a wreath for your front door. Let them take your mind immediately to a park in the middle of a cool, crisp, fall day, full of bountiful, colorful trees and traces of gorgeous, crunching leaves on the paths. Decorative Wedding Plants: Having a fall or autumn wedding? Silk Maple Leaves Garlands are perfect for fall wedding backdrop, floral chandeliers, aisle runner décor, wedding sign topper, maple leaf wreath, hanging ceiling vines, flower girl accessories, banquet table runner, centerpiece, archways decorations, photo booth backdrop, and more. They will bring the warm hues of the harvest season to your fall wedding decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ambjUYIRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B07VX3MRXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VX3MRXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VX3MRXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":800533,"name":"Parade of Red Trees by Master's Art, 35x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7163uHeB-7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a landscape of red trees. Masters Fine Art is a company that travels around the world to bring the best in fine art from outstanding artists from different lands. They believe that art is the sould of the world, that it represents our human essence.MFA works mostly with Latin American art. It portrays a happy view of life, represented with bright beautiful colors, music, dance, love, hope and happiness, giving us the feeling that we can overcome all hardships with all the beautiful things we still have in life. The art Masters FineArt carries is many things: colorful, contemporary, sexy, emotional, musical, romantic.Above all it is beautiful and full of joy. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece.The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame.This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7163uHeB-7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D0YZVH0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0YZVH0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0YZVH0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
