window.products.push({"id":800569,"name":"Meelio Small French Press Coffee Maker, Heat Resistant Borosilicate Glass Coffee Press 12oz with 1 Tea Strainer and 2 Extra Filter Screen, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SVqf0apuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Quality Material: The carafe is made of heat-resistant borosilicate glass that can withstand boiling water without breaking. The 0.3cm extra-thick glass can tremendously extend the service life of the french coffee press. The metal frame is made of food-grade plastic. BPA Free! It is anti-rust, anti-corrosion, and durable. Ultrafine Filtration System: The Meelio small french press has a three-layer filtration system, which can lock the natural oil and the coffee flavor and filter out the coffee grounds. Two additional stainless steel filters are included, you can replace them to get the smoothest taste. The filter system is easy to disassemble and clean. Easy to Brew: The glass french press is suitable for professional coffee experts and novice coffee lovers. Only 4 steps are needed to make a cup of coffee. Whether you're at home, office, or traveling, you can enjoy a fresh cup of coffee anytime. Unique Appearance Design: The 12 oz french press has a butterfly design with a stylish matte black finish, which makes it looks elegant and special for any occasion. Package Included: 1 x matte black coffee french press, 2 x filter screens, 1 x tea strainer. It is a great gift for family and friends! If there are any quality issues, we guarantee to replace your coffee press coffee maker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SVqf0apuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meelio","source_asin":"B09LV3K3G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LV3K3G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LV3K3G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
