window.products.push({"id":800613,"name":"Air Fryer Silicone Pot 7.5inch Easy Cleaning Basket Accessories Air Fryer Basket Accessories (2PCS red+pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmuokxqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Product material】The silicone pot is made of 100% food-grade pure silicone. It’s non-stick, non-toxic, Durable silicone will not deform with long-term use.BPA free and made of highly heat-resistant 【Product Features】The Air fryer pads have many raised lines, which improve the circulation of heat to fully heat the food for a more even doneness. When baking, the grease comes out to the liner, giving you healthier foods. Its pattern is high in the middle and low in the surroundings, which helps the oil from food drain out to the edge of the tray when cooking, preventing food from being soaked by oil. our silicone air fryer basket is dishwasher safe, saving you the hassle of hand washing it. 【Product Size】The top diameter of our air fryer basket is 19cm/7.5inch, the bottom diameter is 16cm/6.3inch, and the height is 6.4cm/2.4inch, and we also come with a pair of standard size silicone heat insulating gloves. 【Easy to Use】Our silicone basket is designed with handles on both sides and equipped to protect your hands from burns when you are removing the silicone pot. Compared with Air Fryer Baking Paper, it is more safe and environmentally friendly, and there will be no safety problems such as flammability. 【Wide Applicaton】The air fryer cookers liner is uitable for air fryer, microwave, oven, steamer, cooker, stove tops etc. The silicone liners can be applied for baking, roasting, frying, or holding food, suitable for home baking, camping, barbecue, summer party, and so on, very practical.This air fryer replacement basket can be the gift for your family/friend who is a cooking lover during holidays and birthdays, the perfect gift for Mother or wife.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmuokxqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOBOBOX","source_asin":"B0BBPMHJCF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBPMHJCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBPMHJCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":800614,"name":"12 Pack Foldable Shoe Box, Stackable Shoe Storage Boxes for Men and Women, Large Shoe Racks Closet Organizer Clear Plastic Shoe Container Organizer fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H6pVD3JPL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"A.DASHER Foldable Shoe Box, Stackable Clear Shoe Storage Boxes - Womens Mens Sneaker Display Containers Closet Organizer Storage Bins Shoe Container Organizer, 12 Pack Door frame integrated Heart-shaped pull ring design, integrated with the lid and snap design, not easy to fall off. Our stackable storage bins are the ideal shoe racks for closets, entryway shoe rack, under clothing rack, bed, storage cabinet or where ever you desire. These shoe racks for closets are also collapsible and space saving - build your collection at your own pace! Those shoe box storage can be used in living room, bedroom, dorm room, underbed etc. Clamshell design The shoe box adopts a flip cover design to make your handling more convenient. Our elegant clear door of the cube organizer allows your shoes to be display in all their glory. The intuitive door opening ensures that you can just grab and go. The shoe container is designed with a small hole on the front so you can put your finger in and pull them out. Large size with drop down lid allows easy access and storage of large size shoes, boots or high heels. Individual containers can be used to organize and keep clean closet, cabinet shelves, drawers, etc. Perfect for storing and organizing shoes, sneakers, toys, cosmetics, etc. Three things you must pay attention to during assembly 1.When assembling the door, be sure to fold the wings on both sides toward the inside of the box, and finally keep the tendency to fold inward. 2.To assemble the shoe box up and down, combine the wings on all three sides of the shoe box up or down with another shoe box. 3.To assemble the shoe box left and right, insert the wings on the left or right side of the shoe box into another shoe box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H6pVD3JPL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A.Dasher","source_asin":"B08922248F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08922248F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08922248F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":800615,"name":"Now Designs Scrub a Dub Dishcloth, Indigo, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tIW8gv31L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Scrub-A-Dub dishcloth from Now Designs is a hearty kitchen companion, designed to tackle all types of dirty dishes. This set contains four matching Scrub-A-Dub dishcloths, each measuring 8 by 6 inches. The front side features soft microfiber that is ideal for wiping up spills and splatters. The reverse side features a textured surface designed to scrub and scour pans without damaging their surfaces. They are safe to use on non-stick pans. Machine wash, hang to dry. Amazon.com Now Designs Color Center Collection Now Designs has been creating beautiful and functional kitchen textiles and table linens for over 40 years. We design high quality aprons, mitts and dish towels in a wide selection of colors and patterns. At Now Designs we take color seriously! We share a love and passion for color. Our mission is to bring color to your kitchen. The Color Center is the foundation of Now Designs. It features a wide array of aprons, mitts, potholders, kitchen towels, dishcloths and kitchen rugs in twelve bright, beautiful colors. We invite you to mix, match and use your creativity and imagination to color your kitchen to reflect your style. Now Designs has got your kitchen covered. Our heavyweight aprons are built to last, and we've got dish towels for every use imaginable. Whether it's scrubbing, washing, drying or polishing, you'll find the best tool for the job in the Color Center. Aprons At Now Designs we've been making our aprons the same way for over 40 years. We start with strong, heavyweight 100% cotton twill, dyed with high quality color-fast dyes, cut it into the ideal classic apron shape and sew it together with high-strength bar-tacks at seven stress points. Put it all together and you've got an apron built to withstand the rigors and abuses of daily use in the busiest kitchens. The neck strap is adjustable for the perfect fit. One size fits all. Basic Mitts and Potholders Made from the same heavy weight twill as our aprons, our mitts and potholders are designed for comfort and heat protection. Utramitts and Ultragrips The Ultramitt and Ultragrip family features heat, steam, and flame-resistant silicone. Grab the hottest pan or dish with confidence. The Ultramitt & Ultragrip's unique pattern of raised squares keeps moisture off the contact surface. It's the same concept that keeps winter tires from slipping. They are made with silicone that has been bonded to cotton under extremely high pressure. The result is a high-tech material that combines the heat protection of silicone with the flexibility of cotton fabric. The Ultramitt's opposable-thumb design is engineered to provide the best fit for all hands, left and right. They are safe to machine wash and dry. Hang-up Towels This unique and highly absorbent 100% cotton towel comes with metal snap closures for hanging over your oven door handle. It comes out of the dryer in ready to use condition - no folding required! Floursack Dishtowels Often imitated, never duplicated, the Now Designs Floursack towel is simply the best for dying dishes and glasses. Perfect lint-free, streak-free drying every time. Generously sized at 20\"x30\". 100% cotton. Symmetry Dishtowels These soft and thirsty jacquard-woven towels are the quintessential multipurpose cloths. 100% cotton. 18\"x28\". Basketweave Dishtowels and Dishcloths These textured striped towels can do it all. Extra absorbent and durable, basketweave dishcloths make doing the dishes a breeze. 100% cotton. Towels are 16\"x25\". Cloths are 14\"x14\". Scrubby Dishcloths Soft cotton terry one side and scrubby mesh on the other, this dishcloth is on double duty. Great for glass and all cookware surfaces, these cloths are gentle but effective. 100% cotton terry with polyester mesh. 10\"x10\". Jumbo Dishtowels Big jobs need big towels. These extra large 24\"x36\" towels are great for drying pots and pans. Each set of three contains one plaid and two stripes. 100% cotton. Barmops Barmops are known for outstanding absorbency and durability. Perfect for wiping down kitchen counters and surfaces. 100% cotton. 16\"x18\". Ripple Towels Dry your hands in the kitchen with luxurious soft Turkish cotton. These thick and thirsty towels are made of the highest quality 100% cotton. 18\"x28\". Waffle Dishcloths These loosely-woven 100% cotton waffle-weave dishcloths are a terrific bargain and add a dash of color to your dish washing routine. Education without Borders A percentage of the profit on the sales of Now Designs product lines go to Education without Borders. The objective of the foundation is to foster educational opportunities and provide educational facilities in disadvantaged regions of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tIW8gv31L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B008YD1M0W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008YD1M0W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008YD1M0W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
