window.products.push({"id":800860,"name":"LovingWay Two-Tone Drawer Liner 17.7x177 Inch Self-Adhesive Corner Shelving Paper Multi Use Furniture PVC Protector Black White Stripes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PvTDB+NwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features:1.Size: 17.7 inch(45cm) wide x 177 inch(4.5 meter) long, 0.1mm thick(Due to hand-made cutting, please leave a deviation of 3-6 cm.)2.Material: PVC paper . Paper Substrate:PVC resin. 3.Printing Technology: Water-based ink printing. Surface Workmanship: Textured.4.Function: Self-adhesive, waterproof, removable. Protect furnitures surface and inner，upgrade wall's looking. 5.Application: Dry and flat surface.6.Package Inclued: 1 X Shelf Liner RollATTENTION:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface.4. Storage methods: stored at cool, dry and ventilated place. Because of PVC material, you can put it in a ventilated place to remove the vinyl smell. 5. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL with the toal length you ordered together in one parcel. But our other warehouse in local will send seperated roll.Installation:1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature.2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water.3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter.4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PvTDB+NwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LovingWay","source_asin":"B082K63ZXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082K63ZXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082K63ZXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":800861,"name":"CYS EXCEL Glass Apothecary Jar. H-18.5\", Body-6.5\" Decorative Classic Candy Buffet Jar, Elegant Glass Storage Container.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719zAhoNNzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"18.5\" Tall Minamilist Apothecary Jar   Dimension: Height: 18.5\" | Opening: 6.75\" | Body Width: 5.5\" | Base: 4.75\" | Thickness: 1/8\"   Purpose: Home Decor, Storage, Preserve, Buffet   Apothecary Jar-History Apothecary is also known as professional medicine. Many doctors require storage units. Glass jars are exceptional because it doesn’t bend or move and provides an ideal barrier against exposure. However, they needed to classify the medical items as being stored-solid, liquid, and pills/capsules. in which one of those methods is changing the shape and size of the jar. Crafters hand-blow Apothecary jars into different sizes and shapes, but to attract buyers, they become more and more beautiful. With the unique designs of the jars, and the change in the way people store their medicine. Apothecary jars are seen less in medicine but more in people's houses and events as Glass Decoration storage units.  Apothecary Jar-Modern Decor Event planners love to use these to store food for people. Not only are they able to hold a large amount of food, but the lids can keep the food warm while denying any dust or critters that might be interested in the food within. The unique design on these jars will attract many that catches sight of it. Made with transparent glass material, it displays all the beautiful items within. As if it's asking you to put your hand inside to grab hold of all the treasures inside.  Straight-forward Design Do not let the circular body fool you. These jars can hold a significant amount of candy inside, with a lid that fits perfectly on top and a simple yet artistic knob. It is not only perfect for keeping items inside safe but also provides easy access for those needing to obtain the things inside. Regardless if you are choosing those with a long or without a long stem. They will add a modern yet elegant feel to the event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719zAhoNNzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYS EXCEL","source_asin":"B004YDAVQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-800861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004YDAVQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004YDAVQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
